   "title": "Lower Delaware National Wild and Scenic River (U.S. National Park Service)",
   "text": "An official website of the United States government\nSearch or ask anything\nAsk DOI Anything - How Can We Help?\nHelp me plan a visit to the Lower Delaware National Wild and Scenic River\nAre there ranger programs or events at the Lower Delaware National Wild and Scenic River?\nWhere can I swim, boat, or fish at the Lower Delaware National Wild and Scenic River?\nAre there alerts or closures at the Lower Delaware National Wild and Scenic River?\nSkip to global NPS navigation\nSkip to this park navigation\nSkip to the main content\nSkip to this park information section\nSkip to the footer section\nNational Park Service\nOpen\nMenu\nLower Delaware\nNational Wild and Scenic River • PA,NJ\nThe Delaware River, the largest free-flowing river in the eastern United States, runs past forests, farmlands and villages. It also links some of the most densely populated regions in America. In 2000, the National Wild and Scenic River System incorporated key segments of the lower Delaware River to form this unit of the National Park System.\nPlan your visit\nAbout the park\nPlan Your Visit\nLearn About the Park\nGet Involved\nInfo\nAlerts\nMaps\nCalendar\nFees\nLargest free-flowing river in the East\nThe Lower Delaware combines high population density with great recreational opportunities as well as natural, cultural and historical sites.\nLast updated: January 5, 2024\nWas this page helpful?\nYes\nNo\nAn official form of the United States government. Provided by Touchpoints\nWalk, Hike and Bike\nRiver Wildlife\nScenic River Program Report\nPlaces to Go\nPark footer\nCONTACT INFO\nMailing Address:\nNPS Wild & Scenic Rivers\n1234 Market Street\nPhiladelphia, PA 19107\nPhone:\n617-981-0466\nContact Us\nTOOLS\nFAQ\nSite Index\nEspañol\nSTAY CONNECTED\nExplore subjects and stories related to this park\nSUBJECT\nBirds & Birding\nSUBJECT\nRivers\nSUBJECT\nHealth & Safety\nExperience Your America.\nDownload the NPS app to navigate the parks on the go.\nSearch\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nFOIA\nNotices\nContact Lower Delaware National Wild and Scenic River\nNPS FAQ\nNo Fear Act\nDisclaimer\nVulnerability Disclosure Policy\nUSA.gov\nOffice of Civil Rights\nLooking for U.S. government information and services? Visit USA.gov\nConnect with the parks you love by joining the National Park Foundation\nSign Up No Thanks",
